From: René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>
Subject: [PATCH] i860: restore the target for binutils, add Linux, dynamic linking and TLS

Restores the i860 port removed from binutils in 2018: bfd, opcodes, gas and ld with i860-*-linux*, dynamic linking and TLS relocations, and their test suites. Generated configure and Makefile.in were patched by hand and not regenerated.

For the binutils-2.47 release tarball, git tag binutils-2_47. Tested in the MAME magicst2 model only, not on real hardware.

Signed-off-by: René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
